{
  "lesson_id": "b1_review_verb_tenses_b1",
  "level": "B1",
  "title": "Review of all intermediate verb tenses (CEFR B1)",
  "description": "Это систематизация основных intermediate verb tenses. Главный навык — выбирать время по значению, а не по механическому списку сигналов.",
  "theory": {
    "rule_id": "RULE-B1-14-RU",
    "lesson_num": 14,
    "title": "Правила: Review of all intermediate verb tenses (CEFR B1)",
    "level": "B1",
    "overview": "Это систематизация основных intermediate verb tenses. Главный навык — выбирать время по значению, а не по механическому списку сигналов.",
    "main_rule": "Present Simple — routine/fact/stable. Present Continuous — current/temporary. Past Simple — completed past. Past Continuous — past process. Past Perfect — earlier past. Present Perfect — past connected to now. Present Perfect Continuous — activity/duration to now. Future forms имеют разные meanings.",
    "form": "V1/V-s; am/is/are + V-ing; V2; was/were + V-ing; had + V3; have/has + V3; have/has been + V-ing; will/going to/Present Continuous.",
    "when_why": "Смотри на relationship: usual, now, finished past, process in past, earlier past, connection with now, duration to now или future meaning.",
    "examples": "I usually work from home. → Я обычно работаю дома.\nI'm working at the office today. → Сегодня я работаю в офисе.\nI finished the report yesterday. → Я закончил отчёт вчера.\nI've already sent it. → Я уже его отправил.\nI was checking the data when my manager called. → Я проверял данные, когда позвонил менеджер.",
    "special_cases": "Не выбирай tense только по одному time expression. Сначала определи meaning and relationship.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ today = всегда Present Continuous. → Нет.\n❌ yesterday = единственное основание выбора. → Смотри на весь контекст.",
    "dont_confuse": "Этот урок — карта системы, а не новый отдельный tense.",
    "quick_summary": "Routine → Present Simple.\nNow/temp → Present Continuous.\nFinished past → Past Simple.\nPast process → Past Continuous.\nPast before past → Past Perfect.\nPast + now → Present Perfect.\nActivity/duration + now → Present Perfect Continuous."
  },
